    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Try Cartoon Survivor and play the first <strong>three levels for free</strong>!\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've <strong>run the temple</strong>.<br>You've <strong>stolen the jetpack</strong>.<br>You've <strong>crossed the road</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you got what it takes to survive the biggest challenge ever!?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378190/extras/b65803c61ebc331f11b39c77aa56b1c9.avif?t=1752454251\" width=616 height=206 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Cartoon Survivor</i>, you\u2019ll face off against an unforgiving prehistoric world full of chaotic obstacles and feisty creatures across five worlds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This 3D adventure runner is bursting with vibrant colours, wild action, and creatures of all shapes and sizes. Encounter rampaging dinosaurs and towering mammoths to sneaky tigers and slithering snakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378190/extras/a3d9fe4df3b3ce876956836a4c924e79.poster.avif?t=1752454251\" width=616 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378190/extras/a3d9fe4df3b3ce876956836a4c924e79.webm?t=1752454251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step could be your last, so you\u2019ll need your wits\u2014and some seriously impressive parkour skills\u2014to stay alive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you conquer the most insane obstacle courses ever designed and bring the Cartoon Survivors\u2019 ratings back from the brink? Your survival is the only thing standing between this show and total cancellation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378190/extras/46da831472a1b67c106ff701035de1b7.avif?t=1752454251\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wild, Colourful Worlds</strong>: Immerse yourself in a bright, cartoonish prehistoric landscape filled with danger, humour, and thrilling obstacles. Think you\u2019ve seen it all? Think again.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crazy Obstacles</strong>: Run, leap, and glide through ever-changing environments and wild courses, each one more intense than the last. Can you make it to the end?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Characters</strong>: Follow in the clumsy, courageous footsteps of the latest cartoon hero. There's over 40 costumes to unlock and creative power-ups to help you along the way!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Gameplay</strong>: Put your speed and reflexes to the test! Every run is different, collectable trophies in each level designed to keep you on your toes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378190/extras/65cb4023c81cd451650bdf159aa90fe3.avif?t=1752454251\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cartoon Survivor Base Game Includes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First 3 levels of the Jurassic World for free</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All costumes and helmets are available to unlock with in-game coins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access all of World 1 and 2 in the <strong>Jurassic and Prehisteria DLC</strong>\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378190/extras/ef4c0038d5d323996756bb9a550240a9.poster.avif?t=1752454251\" width=616 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378190/extras/ef4c0038d5d323996756bb9a550240a9.webm?t=1752454251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Try Cartoon Survivor and play the first <strong>three levels for free</strong>!\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've <strong>run the temple</strong>.<br>You've <strong>stolen the jetpack</strong>.<br>You've <strong>crossed the road</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you got what it takes to survive the biggest challenge ever!?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378190/extras/b65803c61ebc331f11b39c77aa56b1c9.avif?t=1752454251\" width=616 height=206 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Cartoon Survivor</i>, you\u2019ll face off against an unforgiving prehistoric world full of chaotic obstacles and feisty creatures across five worlds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This 3D adventure runner is bursting with vibrant colours, wild action, and creatures of all shapes and sizes. Encounter rampaging dinosaurs and towering mammoths to sneaky tigers and slithering snakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378190/extras/a3d9fe4df3b3ce876956836a4c924e79.poster.avif?t=1752454251\" width=616 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378190/extras/a3d9fe4df3b3ce876956836a4c924e79.webm?t=1752454251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step could be your last, so you\u2019ll need your wits\u2014and some seriously impressive parkour skills\u2014to stay alive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you conquer the most insane obstacle courses ever designed and bring the Cartoon Survivors\u2019 ratings back from the brink? Your survival is the only thing standing between this show and total cancellation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378190/extras/46da831472a1b67c106ff701035de1b7.avif?t=1752454251\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wild, Colourful Worlds</strong>: Immerse yourself in a bright, cartoonish prehistoric landscape filled with danger, humour, and thrilling obstacles. Think you\u2019ve seen it all? Think again.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crazy Obstacles</strong>: Run, leap, and glide through ever-changing environments and wild courses, each one more intense than the last. Can you make it to the end?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Characters</strong>: Follow in the clumsy, courageous footsteps of the latest cartoon hero. There's over 40 costumes to unlock and creative power-ups to help you along the way!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Gameplay</strong>: Put your speed and reflexes to the test! Every run is different, collectable trophies in each level designed to keep you on your toes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378190/extras/65cb4023c81cd451650bdf159aa90fe3.avif?t=1752454251\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cartoon Survivor Base Game Includes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First 3 levels of the Jurassic World for free</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All costumes and helmets are available to unlock with in-game coins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access all of World 1 and 2 in the <strong>Jurassic and Prehisteria DLC</strong>\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378190/extras/ef4c0038d5d323996756bb9a550240a9.poster.avif?t=1752454251\" width=616 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378190/extras/ef4c0038d5d323996756bb9a550240a9.webm?t=1752454251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Survive the wildest adventure of your life in Cartoon Survivor! Run, jump, and glide through a vibrant prehistoric world filled with dangerous creatures and crazy obstacles. Can you outlast the chaos and save the show? It\u2019s time to prove you\u2019ve got what it takes!",
